    if your "Amazoness" monster battled an opponent''s monster while this card is
    already face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone: You can banish that opponent''s monster.
    If this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the GY: You can target 1 "Amazoness"
    monster in your GY; Special Summon it.'
